75,0.287,"moral"],[16.475,0.625,"values"]]},{"layout":"lesson","headline":"Personal Devotion to God Is Superior to Impersonal Worship","visual":["Loving God with a form is more direct","The formless is reached, but with difficulty","God becomes the saviour of His devotees"],"L":["L1"],"say":"Lesson one. Personal devotion to God is easier than impersonal worship. Loving God with a form and a relationship is more direct for most people than meditating on the formless Absolute. Both arrive. But to those who love him, God quickly becomes their saviour.","start":166.728,"at":167.304,"end":185.76,"words":[[0.125,0.45,"Lesson"],[0.588,0.45,"one"],[1.4,0.525,"Personal"],[1.938,0.562,"devotion"],[2.513,0.113,"to"],[2.638,0.388,"God"],[3.038,0.212,"is"],[3.263,0.425,"easier"],[3.7,0.15,"than"],[3.862,0.625,"impersonal"],[4.5,0.65,"worship"],[5.525,0.4,"Loving"],[5.938,0.338,"God"],[6.287,0.163,"with"],[6.463,0.05,"a"],[6.525,0.45,"form"],[6.987,0.125,"and"],[7.125,0.05,"a"],[7.188,0.825,"relationship"],[8.025,0.15,"is"],[8.188,0.188,"more"],[8.387,0.5,"direct"],[8.9,0.113,"for"],[9.025,0.325,"most"],[9.363,0.362,"people"],[9.738,0.138,"than"],[9.887,0.725,"meditating"],[10.625,0.113,"on"],[10.75,0.087,"the"],[10.85,0.5,"formless"],[11.363,0.738,"Absolute"],[12.475,0.287,"Both"],[12.775,0.6,"arrive"],[13.738,0.225,"But"],[13.975,0.1,"to"],[14.088,0.3,"those"],[14.4,0.113,"who"],[14.525,0.237,"love"],[14.775,0.3,"him"],[15.338,0.237,"God"],[15.588,0.438,"quickly"],[16.038,0.412,"becomes"],[16.462,0.15,"their"],[16.625,0.6,"saviour"]]},{"layout":"lesson","headline":"Four Ascending Levels of Spiritual Practice","visual":["Meditate on God, or practise a discipline","Or work for Him, or surrender the results","There is a step for everyone"],"L":["L2"],"say":"Lesson two. Four ascending levels of spiritual practice. If you cannot meditate on God, practise. If you cannot practise, work for him. If you cannot work for him, surrender the results and accept what comes. No one is shut out. Every person can begin exactly where they are.","start":185.76,"at":186.336,"end":207.24,"words":[[0.113,0.463,"Lesson"],[0.588,0.463,"two"],[1.425,0.3,"Four"],[1.738,0.512,"ascending"],[2.263,0.487,"levels"],[2.763,0.15,"of"],[2.925,0.6,"spiritual"],[3.538,0.738,"practice"],[4.675,0.15,"If"],[4.838,0.113,"you"],[4.963,0.425,"cannot"],[5.4,0.537,"meditate"],[5.95,0.15,"on"],[6.112,0.388,"God"],[6.775,0.738,"practise"],[7.912,0.15,"If"],[8.075,0.1,"you"],[8.188,0.388,"cannot"],[8.588,0.65,"practise"],[9.488,0.312,"work"],[9.812,0.138,"for"],[9.963,0.325,"him"],[10.688,0.15,"If"],[10.85,0.113,"you"],[10.975,0.375,"cannot"],[11.363,0.287,"work"],[11.662,0.138,"for"],[11.812,0.3,"him"],[12.387,0.463,"surrender"],[12.863,0.1,"the"],[12.975,0.562,"results"],[13.55,0.138,"and"],[13.7,0.45,"accept"],[14.162,0.188,"what"],[14.363,0.55,"comes"],[15.3,0.225,"No"],[15.537,0.212,"one"],[15.762,0.138,"is"],[15.912,0.275,"shut"],[16.2,0.438,"out"],[17.012,0.3,"Every"],[17.325,0.525,"person"],[17.863,0.175,"can"],[18.05,0.3,"begin"],[18.363,0.537,"exactly"],[18.913,0.2,"where"],[19.125,0.188,"they"],[19.325,0.338,"are"]]},{"layout":"steps","headline":"Better, and better still","visual":["Ritual","Scripture","Meditation","Letting go of results","Peace"],"L":["L3"],"say":"Lesson three. Renouncing attachment to results brings immediate peace. Knowledge of scripture is better than ritual. Meditation is better than knowledge. Letting go of attachment to results is better than meditation. And peace follows immediately. Letting go is the bridge between action and spirit.","start":207.24,"at":207.816,"end":229.368,"words":[[0.113,0.475,"Lesson"],[0.6,0.512,"three"],[1.5,0.588,"Renouncing"],[2.1,0.738,"attachment"],[2.85,0.1,"to"],[2.962,0.512,"results"],[3.487,0.338,"brings"],[3.837,0.562,"immediate"],[4.412,0.55,"peace"],[5.338,0.4,"Knowledge"],[5.75,0.113,"of"],[5.875,0.625,"scripture"],[6.513,0.2,"is"],[6.725,0.35,"better"],[7.088,0.188,"than"],[7.287,0.613,"ritual"],[8.262,0.887,"Med